{"availability":"available","full":"BadrrElGhazaoui/Portfolio","name":"Portfolio","description":"Explore this public GitHub project.","category":"Design","language":"JavaScript","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-10-04T12:31:58Z","updated":"2026-10-09T22:04:04Z","license":null,"branch":"main","homepage":"https://badrelghazaoui.com/","topics":[],"demo":"https://www.sunnypatel.net/","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-09T22:06:11.248Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-09T22:06:11.248Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-09T22:06:11.248Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-09T22:06:11.248Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["An immersive, performant portfolio powered by React, react-three-fiber (Three.js), and Tailwind CSS — featuring a 3D hero scene, animated skills grid, project gallery with tilt effects, and a production-ready contact form (EmailJS + reCAPTCHA) with a real-time Earth canvas backdrop.","This project is a modern single-page application scaffolded with Vite and styled with Tailwind CSS, using react-three-fiber and drei to render high-fidelity 3D scenes. Animations are orchestrated with Framer Motion, and analytics are integrated via @vercel/analytics.","The site includes a custom domain via GitHub Pages CNAME and can also be deployed to Vercel or any static host."],"features":["Environment Variables","3D Hero: Interactive desktop PC GLTF model with OrbitControls (desktop), mobile-friendly auto-rotation, and tuned camera presets.","Starfield Background: GPU-friendly particle starfield using maath and R3F points.","Animated Skills Grid: Hex-styled, animated categories (Programming, IT Tools, Content Production) with responsive row logic.","Projects Gallery: Tilted project cards, tag chips, and quick links to live demos and source."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/BadrrElGhazaoui/Portfolio/blob/main/README.MD","fingerprint":"5738892699ddcc6439fcfa3374f07194e354a0fd405077392bd873cabd88b670","extra